      "title": "Thrift: Fix handling of booleans in Compact protocol",
      "message": "Thrift: Fix handling of booleans in Compact protocol\n\nRecent pull-request in thrift repository revealed that the type used in\ncontainers to indicate boolean values is inconsistent between languages.\n\nWe need to handle that in dissect_thrift_compact_type().\n\nAdditionally, a small bug was found during analysis as the boolean value\nwas generated twice for the same field.\n",
